I've fed your repo into repomix.com but this repo currently sits around 1.15 million tokens, so it will fail when uploaded to Gemini 2.5 Pro (reasoning model). Then I 'compressed code', 'removed comments' and 'removed empty lines' which brings it down to 536k context. Then i fed this file and the comments of this issue and this was the output from 3 runs. Hope it helps.
